# ============ Lewis code-only .gitignore (root-anchored) ============

# --- Data trees (root-anchored; ship only MANIFEST inside /data) ---
/Inputs/
/Outputs/
/Classfiles/
/_archive/
/outputs/
/data/*
!/data/
!/data/MANIFEST.md
/Technical/data/
/Technical/analysis_workspace/
/Technical/Knowledge_Base/
/Technical/output/
/Technical/logs/
/Technical/archive/
/Technical/notebooks/
/Technical/configs/
**/data/raw/
**/data/processed/
**/demo_backfill/
**/output/
**/cache/

# --- Internal / process docs (never publish) ---
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
.cursor/
AGENTS.md
**/Handoffs/
**/HANDOFF_*.md
**/PROGRESS_LOG.md
**/*PROGRESS_LOG.md
**/FINAL_PACKAGE_SUMMARY.md
**/*_PLAN.md
**/*_WISHLIST*.md
**/NEXT_STEPS*.md
**/DECISION_LOG*.md

# --- Data / large binary file types ---
*.parquet
*.feather
*.fst
*.rdb
*.rds
*.RData
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.duckdb
*.zip
*.7z
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.gz
